      "writtenOn": "2025-12-15T09:17:24Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It\u0027s not required but I think no harm including it. It will tell driver to skip unnecessary bookkeeping. Since Dawn already does the bookkeeping itself. AFAIK at least in ANGLE/Vk, this flag can [tell the Vk backend to return early](https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:third_party/angle/src/libANGLE/renderer/vulkan/BufferVk.cpp;drc\u003dd255a3c100425654ffa017a759f4bad92f533b0a;l\u003d800), avoiding any serial checks below.\nI think native drivers would do the same.\nIt might be able to save a few CPU cycles, but a small win is still a win.",
      "parentUuid": "aee6d234_fdb58e26",
      "revId": "8f28123682eac4a87f4a3aa52fd1a27cedfb2040",
